+# Invoice review service
+
+## Purpose
+
+This project reviews invoice line items and returns findings for a human finance operator. It does not authorize or send payments.
+
+## Current implementation
+
+`/src/invoice-review.ts` defines invoice lines with a reference and an amount in cents. It exports duplicate-reference detection that returns each duplicated reference once in sorted order.
+
+The README also describes arithmetic-mismatch review, but the current source does not establish that behavior.
